# BEGIN VIVO DOCKER-USER
# Docker-published ports (go2rtc 1984/8554/8555, Frigate 8971) bypass ufw's
# INPUT rules, so they are filtered here: only the allowed networks get in.
# Managed by gateway/setup.sh; edit site.env (LAN_CIDRS, ADMIN_CIDRS) instead.
*filter
:DOCKER-USER - [0:0]
-A DOCKER-USER -m conntrack --ctstate RELATED,ESTABLISHED -j RETURN
-A DOCKER-USER -i docker0 -j RETURN
-A DOCKER-USER -i br-+ -j RETURN
@ALLOWED_NETWORKS@
-A DOCKER-USER -j DROP
COMMIT
# END VIVO DOCKER-USER
